\ Regression: a spawned task that raised before its send left the scope body
\ blocked on receive forever.
\
\ The sibling-cancellation cascade skipped the body, so nothing woke it. Scope
\ exit was never reached. The first-error walk that lives there never ran.
\
\ The body is now cancelled with its siblings, so the division-by-zero surfaces
\ instead of a silent hang.

[
  out: 1 <buffered-channel> ;
  [ 1 0 / out send ] spawn drop
  out receive print-line
] task-scope
